      },
      "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "baseRefName": "trunk",
      "body": "Fixes #13986\n\n- Replace the `windsurf` agent entry with `devin`\n- Install Devin skills in `.devin/skills` at project and user scope\n- Update install help text and registry tests\n\n## Testing\n\n- `go test ./internal/skills/... ./pkg/cmd/skills/...`",
      "closedAt": "2026-07-29T10:05:19Z",
      "closingIssuesReferences": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "databaseId": 1701557,
              "login": "skarim"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "### Describe the feature or problem you’d like to solve\n\nThe [Cognition](https://cognition.com/) team reached our asking to replace \"Windsurf\" with \"Devin\" in the list of agents, since Cognition has acquired Windsurf and rebranded the app to Devin.\n\nThe install path for any skill files should also be updated to `.devin/skills/`\n\n### Proposed solution\n\n- Rename \"Windsurf\" to \"Devin\" in the list of agents\n- Ensure this installs skill files in `.devin/skills/`\n\n### Additional context\n\nThe rebrand / renaming is documented here: https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/devin-desktop-faq\n",
            "id": "I_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABKecQuQ",
            "number": 13986,
            "repository": {
              "nameWithOwner": "cli/cli"
            },
            "state": "CLOSED",
            "title": "Update Windsurf to Devin in `gh skill` agent list",
            "updatedAt": "2026-07-29T10:51:08Z",
            "url": "https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/13986"
          }
        ],
        "totalCount": 1
      },
      "comments": {
