          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "databaseId": 1701557,
              "login": "skarim"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Ran this by the Cognition team (makers of Devin / Windsurf), and they said this looks good to them ✅ \r\n\r\n> Should this actually remove `windsurf`? Are there still users out there you might be using windsurf and not updating?\r\n\r\nThey confirmed that most users have updated to \"Devin,\" so no need to keep around the legacy \"Windsurf\" option anymore.",
            "createdAt": "2026-07-28T17:56:43Z",
            "id": "IC_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABMHL0mw",
            "isMinimized": false,
            "lastEditedAt": null,
